OL,4,Afuture of humanity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWolfe Herd, Bumble's founder and
OL,7,Fcurrent chief executive, said she would
OL,8,Fremain "actively involved" with the
OL,9,Fbusiness she set up 12 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
